{"version":2,"slug":"how-to-actually-learn-english-with-me","videoId":"rhaTiv7qTjI","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/rhaTiv7qTjI","lang":"en","title":"How to Actually Learn English With Me","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"After helping more than 400 students"},{"start":5,"text":"go from being afraid of making mistakes,"},{"start":10,"text":"being beginner English learners, not"},{"start":14,"text":"even speakers,"},{"start":16,"text":"just learners, to becoming confident"},{"start":20,"text":"English speakers"},{"start":22,"text":"through my"},{"start":23,"text":"English community,"},{"start":26,"text":"I wanted to finally come on YouTube"},{"start":30,"text":"and show you how they did it."},{"start":34,"text":"How you guys did it."},{"start":37,"text":"I started teaching English"},{"start":40,"text":"about 6 years ago."},{"start":43,"text":"When I first started teaching English,"},{"start":47,"text":"I realized pretty quickly"},{"start":50,"text":"that"},{"start":51,"text":"I wasn't the type of teacher to talk"},{"start":54,"text":"about grammar for an hour."},{"start":58,"text":"I realized I was a very patient person"},{"start":62,"text":"and that I really don't mind if I have"},{"start":66,"text":"to repeat myself"},{"start":68,"text":"five times or if it takes someone a"},{"start":72,"text":"little bit longer"},{"start":74,"text":"to find the right word. I actually love"},{"start":79,"text":"that part of teaching. I realized I"},{"start":83,"text":"loved teaching,"},{"start":84,"text":"but I didn't love teaching grammar."},{"start":87,"text":"I loved helping my students to find"},{"start":90,"text":"their voice in English. I wanted my"},{"start":93,"text":"students talking."},{"start":95,"text":"So,"},{"start":96,"text":"instead of just opening a textbook and"},{"start":100,"text":"saying,"},{"start":101,"text":"\"Okay,"},{"start":102,"text":"today we're going to learn about past"},{"start":105,"text":"tense.\" I would turn whatever lesson we"},{"start":110,"text":"were learning that day"},{"start":112,"text":"into an actual conversation."},{"start":116,"text":"That way,"},{"start":117,"text":"learning"},{"start":118,"text":"didn't have to feel"},{"start":120,"text":"like a chore,"},{"start":123,"text":"like something"},{"start":125,"text":"boring"},{"start":126,"text":"or stressful."},{"start":127,"text":"Why can't we enjoy"},{"start":130,"text":"learning English?"},{"start":131,"text":"And I never wanted a student to feel"},{"start":134,"text":"afraid of making a mistake. I wanted my"},{"start":138,"text":"classroom"},{"start":140,"text":"to be a place"},{"start":141,"text":"where you could try."},{"start":144,"text":"Because I started realizing"},{"start":147,"text":"that not every student needed an"},{"start":150,"text":"explanation of English. They needed"},{"start":154,"text":"someone patient enough"},{"start":157,"text":"to let them speak."},{"start":159,"text":"They needed more time to answer"},{"start":162,"text":"while they became better"},{"start":165,"text":"at speaking."},{"start":166,"text":"They needed conversations"},{"start":169,"text":"that were actually interesting. And I"},{"start":171,"text":"realized"},{"start":173,"text":"it's something"},{"start":174,"text":"that nobody [clears throat] else was"},{"start":176,"text":"doing. Finding a way"},{"start":178,"text":"to offer an affordable option"},{"start":182,"text":"for people"},{"start":184,"text":"all around the world"},{"start":186,"text":"to start actually speaking English."},{"start":189,"text":"So,"},{"start":190,"text":"that's when I knew"},{"start":192,"text":"what I had to create."},{"start":195,"text":"I created a space"},{"start":197,"text":"where English learners from all around"},{"start":201,"text":"the world could connect and start"},{"start":204,"text":"speaking English"},{"start":206,"text":"together."},{"start":207,"text":"And it all started with having"},{"start":210,"text":"conversation clubs"},{"start":213,"text":"with all of my students in the Slow"},{"start":216,"text":"English community. I started having"},{"start":219,"text":"conversations every week with around 15"},{"start":224,"text":"to 25 members in my community."},{"start":228,"text":"We would meet once a week and just"},{"start":231,"text":"speak."},{"start":232,"text":"I got to have"},{"start":234,"text":"fun and spontaneous conversations"},{"start":238,"text":"with students and my followers from all"},{"start":242,"text":"around the world."},{"start":244,"text":"It was so much fun to see you guys grow"},{"start":248,"text":"in a way"},{"start":249,"text":"that didn't feel like studying or even"},{"start":253,"text":"learning. We were just having"},{"start":255,"text":"conversations,"},{"start":257,"text":"the way that I've always taught English"},{"start":260,"text":"in real life and in my videos."},{"start":263,"text":"After a little while, it was starting to"},{"start":266,"text":"get difficult for me to teach all of my"},{"start":270,"text":"classes,"},{"start":272,"text":"all of the conversation clubs."},{"start":275,"text":"So then, my dad started helping me. He"},{"start":279,"text":"has been an English teacher for a very"},{"start":283,"text":"long time,"},{"start":284,"text":"more than 15 years. And all he did was"},{"start":289,"text":"have"},{"start":290,"text":"engaging,"},{"start":292,"text":"spontaneous,"},{"start":293,"text":"and fun conversations"},{"start":296,"text":"with the community."},{"start":298,"text":"From topics like languages and accents"},{"start":303,"text":"to colors and smells to deeper"},{"start":306,"text":"conversations about love and"},{"start":309,"text":"intelligence,"},{"start":311,"text":"there is no limit of speaking topics in"},{"start":314,"text":"the Slow English community."},{"start":317,"text":"And I remember the first members loved"},{"start":321,"text":"it. They loved it because there was no"},{"start":324,"text":"pressure to speak. There was absolutely"},{"start":328,"text":"no judgement. And they got to have fun"},{"start":333,"text":"talking about interesting topics every"},{"start":336,"text":"single day"},{"start":338,"text":"alongside"},{"start":340,"text":"other English learners"},{"start":342,"text":"from all around the world. And when I"},{"start":344,"text":"say all around the world."},{"start":348,"text":"I mean it."},{"start":350,"text":"From Mexico to Cambodia, Argentina to"},{"start":354,"text":"Germany,"},{"start":355,"text":"Saudi Arabia to Brazil, the Dominican"},{"start":358,"text":"Republic to Sweden."},{"start":361,"text":"I mean it, everywhere. I'm truly amazed"},{"start":366,"text":"and so proud of this community that"},{"start":369,"text":"we've built together. And the best news"},{"start":372,"text":"you'll hear today"},{"start":374,"text":"is that by the time I post this video,"},{"start":379,"text":"the community"},{"start":380,"text":"will be open. But,"},{"start":382,"text":"not for long."},{"start":385,"text":"The community will close again in 7"},{"start":387,"text":"days, and it won't be opening again for"},{"start":390,"text":"a while. And I do this so that I can"},{"start":393,"text":"control the influx of students, and so"},{"start":397,"text":"that I have the chance to meet all of"},{"start":400,"text":"the new members who join."},{"start":402,"text":"And I love this time of the year, when I"},{"start":406,"text":"get to meet all of the English learners"},{"start":409,"text":"that learn with me every single day. So,"},{"start":413,"text":"if you're ready to start working towards"},{"start":416,"text":"your dreams of speaking English, then"},{"start":420,"text":"this is the time."},{"start":421,"text":"So, don't wait any longer"},{"start":424,"text":"to be the person that you wish to be, to"},{"start":427,"text":"being the version of yourself"},{"start":431,"text":"that doesn't just talk about their"},{"start":434,"text":"dreams, but the person who actually"},{"start":438,"text":"accomplishes them."},{"start":440,"text":"I can't wait to see you guys [music]"},{"start":442,"text":"inside."},{"start":443,"text":"And remember,"},{"start":445,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":448,"text":"Bye."},{"start":457,"text":"[music]"}]}